# Real Sacred Ground logos only (HARD — Founder Oct 28, 2026)

On awnings, windows, signs, and any place the shop name appears: **only the real wordmark files**. Do not let the model invent SACRED GROUND type. That is how plates come back as SACREED / GROUNDD / REALED.

